WEBVTT

NOTE The narration, from the film's own captions.

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.933
Every video editor makes you choose.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.400
Easy... or powerful.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.933
OpenFrame is both.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.500
A magnetic timeline that keeps every edit in sync.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.733
Real color wheels, curves and looks.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.667
Keyframes and motion paths, for graphics that move.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.300
Captions, word by word, styled your way.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.067
A full mixer, and music written for your cut.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.400
Split screens and picture-in-picture, in one click.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.967
And there's one thing no other editor can do.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.367
Any AI agent can edit with you, live, over MCP.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.733
Every change lands on your timeline. And every change can be undone.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:58.000
This film was cut, scored, and narrated by an AI agent, inside OpenFrame.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:04.400
OpenFrame. Free, open source, and yours to build.
